Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,When our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,On your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die\NOn your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.77,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:35.93,Sign,,0,525,400,,{\fs40\b1}Niihama Residential Refugee Sector{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:35.93,Sign,,510,0,400,,{\fs40\b1}Sealed District{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:51.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All teams, designate target building.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:52.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Operation code is I-S.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:54.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Repeat, operation code is I-S.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:05.25,Sign - Copy,,500,0,550,,NEMESIS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:10.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,HQ to all teams. The armed refugees possess\Na sentient tank; exercise extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:14.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Repeat, the armed refugees are armed with\Na sentient tank; exercise extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:19.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,J-1, execute Code I-S and support mobile troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:21.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Neutralise the target upon discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Repeat, neutralise the target upon discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:25.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:27.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if this is just a drill,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:30.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've got to blow up the real thing at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:33.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,J-1, your pulse rate is above normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:34.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you have a medical anomaly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:37.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm fine. I'm good... to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:02:48.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All teams, we have reached the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:52.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unit R-D has completed drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unit S-D has completed drop.\NUnit W-R has completed drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:56.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unit S-J has begun wire drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:58.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unit S-W has begun wire drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:08.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:28.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unit G-2 has neutralised target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:32.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unit G-3 has neutralised target; unable\Nto confirm presence of sentient tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.43,0:03:34.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unit G-4 is also clear; we have\Nneutralised the armed refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.93,0:03:36.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We are unable to confirm the\Npresence of sentient tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:55.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Target confirmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The target has weapons-lock on your unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:03:59.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:02.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,J-1, your pulse rate is above normal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:03.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you still operational?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:05.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:07.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if we're only using dummy shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who the hell could stay calm\Nwith that alarm blaring?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:18.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gotch...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:35.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,J-1, report!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:37.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your pulse rate is zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:47.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:51.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It appears that J-1's pilot has died\Nin the cockpit; cause undetermined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:55.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The support AI has engaged the autopilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At present, J-1's flight status is\Nstable and there is no danger of a crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:03.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,HA-01AV, disengage Code I-S\Nand return to ship ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:07.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Repeat, disengage Code I-S\Nand return to ship ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:10.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Attention all teams: we have an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:15.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,J-1's pilot died in his\Ncockpit for undetermined reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:19.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Disengage Code I-S to prevent\Nany further chance of fatalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:21.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Execute Code S-A and retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:24.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Repeat, execute Code S-A and retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:28.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,HA-01AV has not disengaged Code I-S.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:32.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Its pilot's life signs still read all green.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While his cardiac arrest has been confirmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:36.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there are still vital signals from his cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:41.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We believe this led the support AI to ignore retreat signals\Nfrom the control tower and to prioritise the pilot's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The AI appears to have decided that\Nthe retreat code was an enemy attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:44.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,H-Hey, the Wasps...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.59,Sign,,0,0,410,,{\b1}Department of Defence{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:11.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kubota.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aramaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:18.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems the situation requires expediency.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:25.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems you just can't help digging into anything when there's\Neven the slightest possibility that a crime's involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:38.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For now, we've told the media that the operation was\Nan aerial refuelling drill for units in development.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:43.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In reality, it was the largest scale classified\Nlive-fire drill in the past three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:51.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was conducted in light of the government's\Nupcoming implementation of the new refugee policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:54.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wasn't the machine in question\Nthe same sentient helicopter
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:58.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that got a lot of attention for alleged collusion\Nwith the American Empire regarding our security alliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:07:00.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Actually, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:03.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The GSDF feared the media's attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:03.91,Sign,,0,1400,850,,{\fs52}{\b1\i1}GSDF = Ground Self Defence Force{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so they apparently participated in the drill using one\Nof their own models modified to integrate AI-Support,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:12.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and dubbed it the Digger Wasp Advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:18.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The GSDF believes that this incident\Noccurred because the pilot died accidentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:23.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Given all that information, don't you think\Nthe current situation is too suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:25.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't slip anything by you, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:29.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, how far towards the truth\Nhas your team penetrated?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:34.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,During the live-fire drill,\Nthe pilot of an AI-assisted anti-tank helicopter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:38.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,collapsed at approximately 5:57 AM,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:43.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,after which the support AI's autopilot takeover seemingly\Nresolved the situation, without further problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:47.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, the AI proceeded to ignore the code\Ndisengagement command from the control tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:51.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and entered the residential\Nrefugee sector's airspace at 6:03.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:56.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Furthermore, the AI simultaneously\Nhacked two of its sister units
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.93,0:07:57.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and an airborne refuelling unit that\Nwere stationed on the aircraft carrier.\NFurthermore, the AI simultaneously\Nhacked two of its sister units
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:59.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and an airborne refuelling unit that\Nwere stationed on the aircraft carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:03.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These three hacked units took off\Nfrom the aircraft carrier at 6:12.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:07.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They rendezvoused in the\Nresidential refugee sector
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:11.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and are apparently still\Ncircling above the radio tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:13.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, there is an unconfirmed\Nreport that two sister units
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:19.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,from the military garrison in Awaji\Nand three from the garrison in Wakayama
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:24.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,have also taken off unmanned, under online guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:26.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is also correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:34.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bases that received word of the incident immediately\Nengaged autistic mode on all other sister units.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:39.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but two more units took off from\NItami, which was slow to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:44.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What of the possibility that this is an act of\Ncyber-terrorism that's targeting the support AIs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:47.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Getting past a military firewall\Nto do that would be very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:50.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Taking the possibility of\Nterrorism into consideration,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:54.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,our intelligence division has already detained all personnel\Nwho were involved in the support AI's development
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:56.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and is currently conducting an investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but nothing has been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:01.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What about the possibility of an armed\Nuprising by hotheads within the ranks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:03.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's not possible, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:07.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The particularists couldn't have influenced them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:13.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We even suspected team members who were\Npart of the hedonist cult, Stabat Mater,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:17.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,which has been singled out\Nby the media for attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:18.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That wasn't the case either?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:25.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The leadership is desperate to bring the situation\Nunder control by passing it off as an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:30.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fortunately, the attack choppers are\Nonly circling above the radio tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:34.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,One hopes that's all that'll come of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:37.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The refugees, eh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:41.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And that's what he has to say, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:45.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,His information is neither more\Nnor less than what we've obtained.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.03,0:09:49.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But it looks like the district has been brought under\Nthe control of the Prefectural Police's mobile troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:52.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not only the angry refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:56.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But the GSDF mobile troops, who came to bring the\Nsituation under control, appear to be denied entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:59.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Prefectural Police claim\Nthat they were the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.01,0:10:01.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who were putting their lives on the\Nline trying to exercise jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:04.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.69,0:10:10.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just in case, I'm having Togusa and Ishikawa\Ninvestigate the supposedly-deceased pilot's home;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So what do you want us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:14.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've almost reached the\Nresidential refugee sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:17.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For now, get close to the target and stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:22.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll wait for the Prime Minister's final decision as to\Nwhether this situation falls within our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:23.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:27.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What I said does not leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:31.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It'd be trouble enough if someone\Nwere to see me with you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:36.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You still can't abandon ambition?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:40.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry, but I can't live life the way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:50.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You must be Mr. Aramaki from\NPublic Safety's Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:58.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Cabinet Intelligence Agency, Investigative\NCouncil for Possible Changes to Wartime Strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:03.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That would be Gouda Kazundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:02.17,Sign,,0,700,750,,{\fs52}{\b1}Gouda Kazundo{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:02.17,Sign,,750,0,850,,{\fs52}{\b1}Representative Aide{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.29,0:11:07.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's not often that I come across\Npeople who can read my name correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:10.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even though I don't believe it's all that unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:14.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But now, I believe it is a very good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:19.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, once I tell people the correct\Nway to say it, most people will remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:21.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Especially when they associate it with this face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:28.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, what business does the Cabinet\NIntelligence Agency have with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:36.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We would like Section 9's cooperation\Nto handle the present situation;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:40.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we knew that it would be impolite to ask,\Nbut I decided to approach you directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.25,0:11:46.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am sure you are aware of this fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:50.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but the Cabinet Intelligence Agency is an organisation that,\Nunder the supervision of the Chief Cabinet Secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:54.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,mainly serves to collect and analyse\Nboth domestic and foreign intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:58.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and to sometimes manipulate public opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.53,0:12:03.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We would prefer to have you consider this request to be a\Ndirect order from the Chief Cabinet Secretary himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:10.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, we can hardly expect the Prime Minister's\Ncrisis-management abilities to lead to rapid decision-making.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:29.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:45.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is that thing's refuelling capacity?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:48.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If its specs haven't changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it can supply six years' worth of fuel for a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:55.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though the Digger Wasp is a fuel hog, the tanker\Nshould have enough fuel to keep it airborne for ten hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:59.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, it seems as if it's\Ndistributing fuel to all the units,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:03.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so if you do a simple calculation, each unit\Nshould be able to fly for at least another hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:09.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Assuming that the Digger Wasp has an\Naverage cruise duration of 2.5 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:13.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,one would assume that they have less than\Nan hour's worth of flight time remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's the possibility that that flying\Njerry can over there will go down first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:19.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:21.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Flower Beetle will go down last.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.01,0:13:24.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, it's becoming lighter and lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:27.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That means its cruise duration will increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:32.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, Batou-San. They're AIs, just like us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:39.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, yeah, although they're support-type AIs designed with\Nthe assumption that there'll be a human pilot on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.21,0:13:42.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, not only are they presently without pilots,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:44.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they're also staying airborne\Nof their own free will, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:49.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They really must've disliked\Ntheir labour conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are the military's labour conditions that harsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:56.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Jeez, gloomy AIs snap so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:14:01.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We still have to fight them if we get orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.01,0:14:03.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:07.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Anti-tank helicopters would be\Nour natural enemies, right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:11.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou-San, Batou-San!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:12.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:16.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can we go home? We have upset stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.97,0:14:18.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stomachs? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:28.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Looks like the GSDF went too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:32.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They tried to dive into the\Nsupport AIs and failed, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:42.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The GSDF pilot's salary must be pretty low, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:01.65,Sign,,0,0,725,,{\fs52}{\b1}Revenge{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:01.65,Sign,,0,350,550,,{\fs52}{\b1}Samurai{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:01.65,Sign,,0,1200,400,,{\fs52}{\b1}Ueda SDF Store{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:23.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:27.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's going on? Why did you\Nbother to come all the way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:30.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Were you unable to free yourself\Nfrom the Prime Minister's "leash"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:37.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He is an agent with the Cabinet\NIntelligence Agency, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:41.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A representative aide of the Investigative Council\Nfor Possible Changes to Wartime Strategy, Gouda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.51,0:15:42.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will state the conclusions first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:51.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Section 9 will soon be granted complete\Nfreedom to resolve this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:56.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, I'd like for you to conduct the\Noperation entirely according to his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:58.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Old man, are you insane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:04.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We didn't stay in Section 9 just\Nto become the government's dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.81,0:16:06.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,According to our calculations,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:11.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the first unit will crash into the\Nresidential refugee sector in 48 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:14.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The damage will become\Nirreparable once that occurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:16.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is obviously an act of terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:17.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:19.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's hear your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:24.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nice and obedient; good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:30.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, assuming we take\Neverything he said at face value,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:32.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,why would you agree to his plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:37.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even supposing that the pilot's sudden death and\Nthe AI's rampage weren't an act of terrorism,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:42.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,if one of the helicopters crashes,\Nthis area will sustain damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.43,0:16:47.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There is no guarantee that the refugee situation\Nwon't become a powder keg if that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:52.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, without his information,\Nwe didn't have a hand to play, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:56.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What I meant to ask was what our\Nstance was in all of this, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:58.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:02.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:04.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:05.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:22.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, they indiscriminately\Nattack anything that moves...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.66,0:17:23.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:38.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.93,0:17:51.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're gonna come after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:01.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't go back down to ground level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:04.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we do, we won't be able to\Nevade Air-to-Surface Missiles if they lock on to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:30.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The odds are totally against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:33.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not only is the ratio two-to-one,\Nbut we're inferior in firepower to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good, it's as he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.05,0:18:50.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, the target unit is tailing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:51.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:11.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Target confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:13.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, when you pass in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:15.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,make the target tilt up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:18.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd like to shoot through the canopy's side
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:20.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in order to shoot the pilot\Nwithout destroying the AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:21.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:56.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:45.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It accepted the control tower's\Ncode disengagement command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.99,0:20:58.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm glad our predictions were accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.98,0:21:02.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We predicted that once the cyberbrain signals of the\Npilot, who had suffered cardiac arrest, were cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:07.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the support AI would accept the control\Ntower's code disengagement command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.76,0:21:12.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, I exercised good judgement\Nin requesting your aid in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.36,0:21:17.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thanks to you, we were able to avoid having the SDF\Ntroops bear the stain of having killed one of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:18.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:22.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You mean you don't care if\NSaitou has to bear that stain?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.62,0:21:25.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:36.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:41.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The return of all eleven units has been confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:44.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have you heard Togusa's report?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:45.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:50.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Cardiac medication was found in that pilot's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.73,0:21:53.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It appears he was hiding his\Nailment from his superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.03,0:21:57.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, are you suggesting that this incident\Nwasn't an act of terrorism, as Gouda insisted,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:21:57.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but instead was just an accident?\NThen, are you suggesting that this incident\Nwasn't an act of terrorism, as Gouda insisted,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:59.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but instead was just an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:00.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:07.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Until we conduct a structural analysis of the\Nmedication we found and the deceased pilot's blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:09.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there's no way to confirm either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:15.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Cabinet Intelligence Agency's aide appeared at just\Nthe right moment, and it seemed as if he knew everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.12,0:22:23.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, the GSDF helicopters flew directly above the\Nrefugees in such a way as to unnecessarily provoke them,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:26.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,as if that was their intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.15,0:22:29.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is the significance of all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.34,0:22:36.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It could be that crime on a massive scale\Nis in the works, somewhere unknown to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:11.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.06,0:23:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\b1}of planets and stars within {\b0}me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.20,0:23:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\b1}Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.73,0:23:20.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:24.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:35.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:37.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:37.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.75,0:23:39.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:41.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.93,0:23:42.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:43.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:44.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:45.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.81,0:23:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:49.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.51,0:23:50.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:50.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:51.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.\NAll I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.51,0:23:53.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:54.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:23:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:00.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:01.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:02.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:04.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:07.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.15,0:24:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.83,0:24:09.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.23,0:24:10.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.43,0:24:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:12.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.93,0:24:13.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:15.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)\NAll the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.75,0:24:16.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:20.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.38,0:24:20.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside\Nto make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:21.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:26.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
